spell.highlands-town.runeBas08.descripti:
{Advanced Rune of Resurrection}

Resurrect the health of fallen troops; except for war machines, mechanical, golems and undead creatures can be resurrected.

The resurrection value is (P*40)+30, and it will not be retained after the battle.

{Basic Rune of Resurrection}

Resurrect the health of fallen troops; except for war machines, mechanical, golems and undead creatures can be resurrected.

The resurrection value is (P*40)+5, and it will not be retained after the battle.

{Expert Rune of Resurrection}

Resurrect the health of fallen troops; except for war machines, mechanical, golems and undead creatures can be resurrected.

The resurrection value is (P*40)+45, which is retained after the battle.

